  "title": "AI Medtech Specialist Firefly Lists on Nasdaq after Merger",
  "summary": "Canada’s Firefly Neuroscience has completed a listing on the Nasdaq via a $45 million reverse merger with IT group WaveDancer, opening up new financing routes for its artificial intelligence-powered platform for measuring brain function. The combined company will operate under the Firefly Neuroscience banner and focus its efforts on commercialising the company’s FDA-cleared Brain Network...",
